  eventID: FacilityExited
  dialogueLines:
  - "Okay, damn, I guess experiments aren\u2019t really your thing. You didn\u2019t
    have to leave that quickly"
  - "Wow, you really couldn\u2019t get out of there fast enough, huh? I guess experiments
    aren\u2019t for everyone"
  - Oh, okay. I see how it is. You took one look at the experiment and immediately
